@@ -0,0 +1,205 @@
+/*
+ *************************************************************************
+ * Ralink Tech Inc.
+ * 5F., No.36, Taiyuan St., Jhubei City,
+ * Hsinchu County 302,
+ * Taiwan, R.O.C.
