+	Note: downMCS, upMCS3, upMCS2 and upMCS1 are zero-based array index.
+
+	[Mode]*: 
+		bit0: STBC -STBC_XXX
+		bit1: Short GI - GI_XXX
+		bit2~3: BW - BW_XXX
+		bit4~bit6: Mode (0:CCK, 1:OFDM, 2:HT Mix, 3:HT GF, 4: VHT) - MODE_XXX
+		bit7: Reserved
+
+	[Mode]**
+		bit0~1: Nss - NSS_XXX (VHT only)
+		bit2~7: Reserved
+*/
